{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05099","headline":"扈从出长安应制 · 沈佺期","name":"扈从出长安应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉宅规模壮，周都景命隆。\n西宾让东主，法驾幸天中。\n太史占星应，春官奏日同。\n旌门起长乐，帐殿出新丰。\n翕习黄山下，纡徐清渭东。\n金麾张画月，珠幰戴松风。\n是节严阴始，寒郊散野蓬。\n薄霜沾上路，残雪绕离宫。\n赐帛矜耆老，褰旒问小童。\n复除恩载洽，望秩礼新崇。\n臣忝承明召，多慙献赋雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}